    {
      "text": "Cropped page region with a framework diagram of three stacked chevrons: indicators (stakeholders, eHealth outcomes, eHealth outputs, output and outcome indicators), measures (monitoring and evaluation timeframes, baseline measures, target measures) and governance (governance structures, functions and processes). The heading text is cut off.",
